ng ground. An <strong>unknown entity</strong>, described as a swamp dweller, disables power, attempts to unlock your shacks doors &amp; only attacks when you're not watching out. The more anomalies active, the stronger the create becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to <strong>balance your research duties with survival</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Restore power to the shack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Avoid detection while researching the swamp dweller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Submit your findings alongside the anomalies reported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Report anomalies found on cameras around the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878610/extras/2504cf90146d927097efe14ff35bffe2.poster.avif?t=1787747782\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878610/extras/2504cf90146d927097efe14ff35bffe2.webm?t=1787747782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878610/extras/2504cf90146d927097efe14ff35bffe2.mp4?t=1787747782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shack isn't sturdy enough to withstand many attacks from the dwelling swamp creatures. For every correct anomaly reported grants you credit for upgrades. Improve your shack, researching tools, software's &amp; cameras. Each night grows more unstable, and every report brings you closer to unraveling the truth behind the ERU  and Ivy’s connection to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric blend of <strong>observation horror and survival gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique anomaly reporting system with escalating difficulty</p><p 